cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CryptoServe Census
message: >-
  Cite the dated dataset you used, not the repository. Each directory under
  datasets/ is an independent, immutable release with its own collection date.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: CryptoServe
    website: https://census.cryptoserve.dev
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/opena2a-org/crypto-census-data
url: https://census.cryptoserve.dev
abstract: >-
  Cryptographic dependency adoption across eleven public package registries.
  Each dataset records, per ecosystem, how many packages were examined and how
  many depend on a catalogued cryptographic library, split across weak, modern
  and post-quantum tiers. Counts are of packages examined, not of packages using
  cryptography; every published share is over the crypto-using subset.
keywords:
  - cryptography
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - software supply chain
  - package registries
  - dependency analysis
